<title>CANADA: Alberta Wheat Pool forecasts high grain quality.</title>
<headline>Alberta Wheat Pool forecasts high grain quality.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Wheat Pool on Friday forecast high grain and oilseed quality with 26 percent of all crops harvested to date.</p>
<p>Sixty-six percent of hard red spring wheat will grade No1 Canada Western Red Spring, AWP said.</p>
<p>Eighteen percent of hard red spring wheat will grade No2 CWRS, 13 percent No3 CWRS and four percent as feed wheat.</p>
<p>Twenty-three percent of barley will grade as malt, 69 percent as No1 Canada Western, eight percent as No2 CW.</p>
<p>Eighty-three percent of canola will grade No1 Canada, 14 percent No2 Canada and three percent No3 Canada.</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
